ul machine. Win the races, master your <strong>inventory of parts</strong>, and uncover the truth in this <strong>retro pixel racer</strong> packed with heart and horsepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.poster.avif?t=1757358693\" width=784 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.webm?t=1757358693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/7e0828a3931a108abe429bea3797956e.mp4?t=1757358693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770240/extras/a13636a85301274cea28f01319a8b1da.avif?t=1757358693\" width=800 height=112 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude97 <strong>Customize. Race. Upgrade. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a garage of <strong>pixel-perfect cars</strong> \u2014 from street beasts to tuned monsters. <strong>Customize every detail</strong> of your ride: upgrade engines, equip turbos, swap wraps, apply spoilers, and more. Every choice impacts your <strong>drag performance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Full Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Built for gamepads &amp; keyboards<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Paint Shop</strong> \u2013 Style your ride with colors and themes<br>\u26fd <strong>Fuel Station</strong> \u2013 Manage your fuel for every run<br>\ud83d\udca6 <strong>Car Wash</strong> \u2013 Keep your machine show-ready<br>\ud83d\udea7 <strong>Garage Customization</strong> \u2013 Spoilers, wraps, bumpers, wheels, stickers<br>\ud83e\ud